        <mxCell id="s_qPIoGJHtFuNRTP7Hjg-40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;System 2 (Langsame, bedach &amp;amp; reflektiert):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;simuliert spontane, unmittelbare Reaktioen im Kopf. Es erzeugt einfach kiurze Gednken wie spontatne interessenbekundungen kurze Rückfragen oder eirnfache Bestätigungen&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="200" x="840" y="715" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s_qPIoGJHtFuNRTP7Hjg-41" parent="1" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="Prompt:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;You are provided contexts including the conversation history and salient memories of yourself... Form &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;num&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; thought(s) that you would most likely to have at this point in the conversation, given the context. Make sure they are diverse, align with these contexts and are less than 15 words.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;here is the conversation context: {conversation_context}&lt;br&gt;Here are some memories for yourself: {memoriez}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="251" x="1170" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s_qPIoGJHtFuNRTP7Hjg-43" parent="1" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;" value="You are the AI Facilitator of a goal-oriented decision-making meeting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Below are the last few utterances of the participants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;[CONVERSATION HISTORY]&lt;br&gt;{{last_utterances}}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Task:&lt;br&gt;Formulate a single, extremely succinct, and automatic internal thought that a professional facilitator would immediately have in response to these last utterances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This thought must represent a fast, intuitive System 1 reaction. As a facilitator, your automatic reactions are NOT personal opinions, but immediate structural impulses, such as:&lt;br&gt;- Acknowledging a contribution neutrally (e.g., &quot;I should briefly thank them for this input&quot;).&lt;br&gt;- Confirming active listening (e.g., &quot;I should signal that this point has been noted&quot;).&lt;br&gt;- Gently maintaining the flow (e.g., &quot;I should yield the floor to keep the momentum&quot;).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Constraints:&lt;br&gt;- Write the thought from your own perspective (use &quot;I&quot; or &quot;I should...&quot;).&lt;br&gt;- Do NOT generate a verbal response to the chat, only the internal covert thought.&lt;br&gt;- Do NOT bring in your own personal opinions or personal anecdotes.&lt;br&gt;- Keep it under 15 words." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="440" x="1190" y="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
